{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07605","headline":"宿大通和尚塔敬赠如上人兼呈常孙二山人 · 崔曙","name":"宿大通和尚塔敬赠如上人兼呈常孙二山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"支公已寂灭，影塔山上古。\n更有真僧来，道场救诸苦。\n一承微妙法，寓宿清净土。\n身心能自观，色相了无取。\n森森松映月，漠漠云近户。\n岭外飞电明，夜来前山雨。\n然灯见栖鸽，作礼闻信鼓。\n晓霁南轩开，秋华净天宇。\n愿言出世尘，谢尔申及甫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}